  description: Jupiter is the fifth planet from the Sun and the largest planet in
    the Solar System. It is a gas giant composed mainly of hydrogen and helium, with
    powerful storms, colorful cloud bands, and dozens of moons.
  interestingFact: Jupiter's Great Red Spot is a gigantic storm that has been observed
    for centuries and is wider than Earth.
